    "en": {
      "name": "Bingo Card",
      "effect": "Choose 1 monster in a column with all zones occupied and destroy as many cards in that column as possible, then each player draws 1 card. You can banish this card from your GY, then activate 1 of these effects;\n\u25cf Destroy 5 monsters in your Main Monster Zone or 5 cards in your Spell & Trap Zone, then draw 2 cards.\n\u25cf Destroy 5 monsters in your opponent's Main Monster Zone or 5 cards in their Spell & Trap Zone, then they draw 2 cards.",
      "official": false
    },
